<!--
  ParticlesEmitter.binaryclass.xml
  Comprehensive emitter class definition extracted from WDL leak (W2EM/W3EM XMLs).
  Covers PartEmit elements inside ParticlesEmitterLibrary XML.
  
  Naming conventions (C++ internal → XML attribute):
    b* = Boolean, f* = Float, s* = String, hid* = BinHex (hash ID)
    vector* = Vector3, sel* = Enum, text_* = String (hash text repr)
    dis* = BinHex (Disrupt internal), snd* = BinHex (sound)
  
  KF curve types:
    Init* = initial value (ValueKF + VariantKF children)
    Part* = per-particle value (curve="Count(N) BASE64" attribute)
    Color* = color curve (times + colors base64 attributes)
  
  Source: leak/ubisoft/data/Databases/ParticlesEmitters/W2EM_*.xml (155 files)
          leak/ubisoft/data/Databases/ParticlesEmitters/W3EM_*.xml (WDL)
          141 unique attributes, 43 child element types
-->
